        "7.8.8 转发MODBUS服务配置",
        "7.8.8.4 Modbus TCP普通调度模式"
      ],
      "section_title": "7.8.8.4 Modbus TCP普通调度模式",
      "block_type": "list",
      "text": "•\n无动作：通讯恢复后，数据采集器将根据后台最近一次下发的目标值，调整逆变器的\n输出功率。",
      "table_cells": null,
      "bbox": [
        115.911,
        309.906,
        463.086,
        334.359
      ],
      "extraction_method": "native_text",
      "needs_review": false,
      "review_notes": []
    },
    {
      "block_id": "BLK-C7E8E31272018DA3",
      "document_id": "DOC-C034D56CBBB3",
      "source_sha256": "5a9b4f97ff44c0e39b26b5dff963b60b40eede9431301fd5c6324ac9da5f1d99",
      "parser_version": "1.5.0",
      "pdf_page": 77,
      "printed_page_label": "67",
      "block_order": 13,
      "section_id": "SEC-E41950E8A81762D3",
      "section_path": [
        "7 Web界面",
        "7.8 系统",
        "7.8.8 转发MODBUS服务配置",
        "7.8.8.4 Modbus TCP普通调度模式"
      ],
      "section_title": "7.8.8.4 Modbus TCP普通调度模式",
      "block_type": "list",
      "text": "•\n开机：数据采集器先对逆变器下发开机指令，再根据后台最近一次下发的目标值，调\n整逆变器的输出功率。适用于逆变器因通讯异常而关机的情况。",
      "table_cells": null,
      "bbox": [
        115.911,
        338.406,
        463.086,
        362.859
      ],
      "extraction_method": "native_text",
      "needs_review": false,
      "review_notes": []
    },
